<title>USA: USDA to donate rice, veg oil to Equatorial Guinea.</title>
<headline>USDA to donate rice, veg oil to Equatorial Guinea.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Agriculture Department Thursday said it would donate about 640 tonnes of vegetable oil, milled rice and pinto beans to the International Partnership and Human Development, a private voluntary group, to distribute in Equatorial Guinea.</p>
</text>
